      "notes": "chance, stunSeconds and bonusDamage are 0: no trigger code holds these values. Trig_Learn_Allstun_Conditions/Actions (war3map.j v20.75, lines 27692-27702) enable the Trig_AllStun_* trigger once A00M is learned. Trig_AllStun_Func001Func002C, Trig_AllStun_Func001C and Trig_AllStun_Conditions (27704-27732) let it fire on every cast of A0A7, A0AA or A0A8 by O00C, with no chance roll. Trig_AllStun_Actions (27734-27739) then creates one dummy unit (e012, timed life 1 s) that casts A0A9 at the caster's A00M level. Stun length and damage are A0A9's object data, not script: duration 1, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3; DataA damage 150, 300, 450, 600, 750; area 350. AI_Setup (32758) only lists A00M as hero slot 2 of O00C."
    }
